--------------------------
✅ TEST-MAP-001: Center Map Button - Tests GPS centering accuracy
✅ TEST-MAP-002: Fly To Click Navigation - Tests click-to-fly commands  
✅ TEST-MAP-003: Drone Position Accuracy - Tests marker positioning

